      "writtenOn": "2018-09-28T11:53:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding is that: In ConnectivityServiceTest, NetworkPolicyManagerInternal is mocked because there is no NPMS accessible for ConnectivityServiceTest. If we want to use the real methods in NPMS, like isUidNetworkingBlocked(), we have to new NPMS in ConnectivityServiceTest#setup() before WrappedConnectivityService is constructed.\nNot sure if it\u0027s doable or if there\u0027s other better ways to do.",
      "parentUuid": "904fdca8_c99304e8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4503,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 4503,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "ca5837d235bcb6161e190bafbf3375ee46386b9e",
